          <p class="eyebrow">How LDW applies this</p>
          <h2>Keep ownership clear before adding more technology.</h2>
          <p class="lede">LDW normally prefers customer-owned production accounts with named, scoped provider access, documented recovery, and an explicit handoff path. Ongoing support can continue without making the business dependent on hidden provider ownership.</p>
